            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset contains information about the paving expenses made by Ghent's city government during the first half of the 15th century (1401-1455). Each line corresponds to one mention of paving location in the city account. Two columns correpond to the GIS identifer of the location. NB: during the 15th century, expenses are no longer registered per year but per month, which increases automatically the number of expenses since a paving site could be mentioned several time in the register if the work last more than one month.</p>"
                }
              },
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
